<title>USA: NVR Inc authorizes up to $10 mln buy-back.</title>
<headline>NVR Inc authorizes up to $10 mln buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>NVR Inc said Wednesday its directors authorized the use of up to $10 million for the repurchase of its outstanding common stock. NVR said purchases will occur from time to time in the open market and/or in privately negotiated transactions as market conditions permit.</p>
<p>NVR said the authorization was a continuation of the stock repurchase program that began three years ago and is consistent with NVR's strategy of maximizing shareholder value.  The McLean, Virginia, homebuilder has 12,240,276 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
